OL,3,GNEWSAThe stress and strain on pupils as
OL,4,Aresults day arrives
OL,5,
OL,6,FExam results days can be times of often
OL,7,Fconflicting emotions for young people.
OL,9,FThe schools where pupils gather with
OL,10,Ffriends in the morning to receive their
OL,11,FGCSE grades will witness joy, relief,
OL,12,Fupset and sometimes confusion.
OL,14,FExam pressure is all too real among
OL,15,Fteenagers after a nail-biting wait for
OL,16,Fthe results of papers they sat in May
OL,17,Fand June.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
